that it also allows you to
disseminate the information

00:50:28.430 --> 00:50:36.230
electronically, it can, you
could do it in paper. And I

00:50:36.230 --> 00:50:41.360
think that comics really taps
into the visual language that

00:50:41.360 --> 00:50:46.910
people are used to, and can
consume easily. When I first

