course of those interviews, we

00:51:01.040 --> 00:51:04.280
identified specific topics that
would be important to their

00:51:04.280 --> 00:51:07.250
clients had, of course nothing
to do with them coming to

00:51:07.250 --> 00:51:09.890
America, they already knew about
that. What they didn't know was,

00:51:10.070 --> 00:51:12.740
