00:51:44.810 --> 00:51:49.400
the comic. This comic was then
disseminated within courthouses

00:51:49.610 --> 00:51:55.280
to sister organizations across
the United States, and could be

00:51:55.280 --> 00:51:59.480
available digitally and in comic
book form. Think BORDERx is

00:51:59.480 --> 00:52:03.500
doing a such a great example of
comics and activism. Because

00:52:03.560 --> 00:52:06.470
there was an idea, I want to
help immigrants, there was an

00:52:06.470 --> 00:52:12.800
